{"id":"660650","name":"番茄鸡蛋虾滑","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/660650/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"番茄","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾滑","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄去皮洗净切薄片。","img":"images/660650/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋打入碗中搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/660650/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油倒入蛋液，大火炸。","img":"images/660650/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"炸至鸡蛋金黄盛出备用。","img":"images/660650/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中底油放入番茄翻炒。","img":"images/660650/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽，盐。","img":"images/660650/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀炒出茄汁。","img":"images/660650/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/660650/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"舀入虾滑（虾滑是买的安井的半成品）。","img":"images/660650/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将虾滑煮至定型。","img":"images/660650/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入炸好的鸡蛋。","img":"images/660650/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"煮开中小火焖个两三分钟左右入味。","img":"images/660650/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅前少许淀粉水勾薄茨即可。","img":"images/660650/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660650/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660650/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/660650/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}